@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC10 Soan va gui ban thuyet minh

actor "Vendor" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - MediaLibraryPage tab Ban thuyet minh" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nNarrationsController + NarrationDraftService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nApplicationDbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Chon POI va nhap noi dung thuyet minh
UI -> UI: Kiem tra tieu de, ngon ngu va noi dung
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau tao narration draft
Business -> Business: Kiem tra role Vendor va user id
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI, owner, Language va draft hien co
DataAccess -> Database: Doc du lieu lien quan
Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
DataAccess --> Business: Tra POI va tinh trang trung lap
alt POI thuoc Vendor va du lieu hop le
  Business -> Business: Tao draft trang thai Pending
  Business -> DataAccess: Ghi NarrationDraft
  DataAccess -> Database: Luu draft va nguoi gui
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra draft moi
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua thanh cong
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach cho duyet
else Khong tim thay, sai owner, sai ngon ngu hoac bi trung
  Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi va giu form
end
@enduml
